# INVWINSN.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: loans of several
# items at level 3.  CTRL-L with items 1 to 3 selected shows one Lend
# form, the help panel saying it is for each of them; its borrower and
# dates lend all three, the note counting them.  Items > Loans and holds
# lists the three loans; with two selected Return or release (ALT-C R)
# asks one return date and
# returns both, the open loans then the third alone.  Every date is
# typed, so that no snapshot holds the day of the run.  The end by
# Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINSN.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/selchk.py
# checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN CTRL-L
S LEND
K TAB
T Carol King
K TAB TAB
T 2020-01-01
K TAB
T 2020-02-01
K ENTER
S LENT
K ALT-I O
S LOANS
K SHIFT-DOWN
S LOANSEL
K ALT-C R
S ASKRET
T 2026-10-03
K ENTER
S RETURNED
K ALT-F X
